flowchart TD
    %% Harness Maintenance — implementation authority:
    %% harness-maintain/SKILL.md, cli.py, harness/doctor.py, and handlers/lifecycle.py

    START(["Invoke /harness-maintain<br/>repository-level skill · feature optional"]):::terminal
    START --> CONTEXT["Load named route context<br/>harness-config.yaml · core policies"]:::step
    CONTEXT --> MODE{Select bounded mode}:::decision

    MODE -->|assess| ASSESS["Assess<br/>run doctor --root &lt;repo&gt; --json<br/>check manifest drift · config health<br/>orphan feature directories"]:::assess
    ASSESS --> REPORT["Terminal Report<br/>manifest drift and health"]:::output

    MODE -->|create| CREATE["Create<br/>use assessment evidence to identify<br/>missing standard directories or seeds"]:::create
    CREATE --> INIT["Propose or run approved scaffolding<br/>cli.py init / focused file creation<br/>without overwriting adopter-owned content"]:::create

    MODE -->|improve| IMPROVE["Improve<br/>inspect gate failure evidence<br/>and test outcomes"]:::improve
    IMPROVE --> DRAFT["Draft evidence-backed [DRAFT] heuristics<br/>in learned-heuristics.md<br/>never silently promote policy"]:::improve

    MODE -->|eval| EVAL["Eval<br/>doctor package contracts · inspect CC-* rules<br/>validate confirmed gate configuration<br/>optionally verify a selected feature"]:::assess
    EVAL --> EVAL_OUT["Record findings and comparative evidence<br/>without inventing gate results"]:::output

    MODE -->|doctor| DOCTOR["Doctor<br/>run deterministic package-health checks"]:::doctor
    DOCTOR --> CHECKS["manifest · ownership · surfaces · routes<br/>skills · commands · providers · upgrade_contracts<br/>static audit · configuration · project_setup"]:::doctor

    MODE -->|diagnose| DIAGNOSE["Diagnose<br/>map reported symptom to context,<br/>constraint, feedback, architecture, or scope"]:::diagnose
    DIAGNOSE --> FIX["Propose the smallest targeted fix<br/>and a reproduction-based verification step"]:::diagnose

    REPORT --> REVIEW
    INIT --> REVIEW
    DRAFT --> REVIEW
    EVAL_OUT --> REVIEW
    CHECKS --> REVIEW
    FIX --> REVIEW

    REVIEW{User approval needed<br/>for configuration, policy,<br/>or runtime changes?}:::decision
    REVIEW -->|Yes| APPROVE["Present evidence, proposed diff,<br/>risk, and verification plan"]:::approval
    APPROVE -->|approved| APPLY["Apply focused maintenance change<br/>then rerun doctor and relevant checks"]:::step
    APPROVE -->|not approved| END
    REVIEW -->|No| END
    APPLY --> END(["Report repaired items,<br/>verification, and remaining gaps"]):::terminal

    classDef terminal fill:#111827,stroke:#111827,color:#fff
    classDef decision fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#f59e0b,color:#78350f
